<title>NETHERLANDS: PORC FLES BACK IN PROFIT IN 1996.</title>
<headline>PORC FLES BACK IN PROFIT IN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.34  vs   0.85  loss</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.321 vs   0.186 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover				 7.91  vs   7.56</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     0.541 vs   0.217</p>
<p>NOTE - Ceramic goods maker Porceleyne Fles said it expected</p>
<p>1997 turnover to be broadly similar to the 1996 level and that</p>
<p>1997 profits could turn out slightly higher than in 1996 if this</p>
<p>indded proved to be the case. It said it had placed 23,500 new</p>
<p>shares with a major shareholder at a price of 25 guilders each.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
